{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_018bKqESPM2XVorX6oEuT7hv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have enough context to plan.\n\n## Current State\n- `layout.tsx` has `alternates.types` metadata with both RSS and JSON Feed (Next.js generates `<link rel=\"alternate\">` tags), and an explicit `<link>` in `<head>` for JSON Feed — but NO explicit RSS `<link>` tag.\n- `site/src/app/feed.json/route.ts` exists with valid JSON Feed 1.1 structure but returns ALL posts, not limited to 10.\n- `site/src/app/feed.json/route.test.ts` does not exist.\n\n## Problem Identified\nAC1 requires the RSS link tag in `<head>`. AC2 requires limiting to 10 posts. The test file is missing.\n\n## Planned Changes\n- `site/src/app/layout.tsx`: Add `<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" href=\"/feed.xml\" />` in `<head>`\n- `site/src/app/feed.json/route.ts`: Add `.slice(0, 10)` to limit posts\n- `site/src/app/feed.json/route.test.ts`: Create test file verifying JSON Feed 1.1 structure\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [\"site/src/app/feed.json/route.test.ts\"],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/app/layout.tsx\", \"site/src/app/feed.json/route.ts\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 40\n}\n</plan>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":773,"cache_read_input_tokens":39365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":773},"output_tokens":33,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48cd3948-144c-45c7-ae83-7eda8bdfa883","uuid":"56698d86-e1b3-4948-8a8b-eaa72da5e690"}
